MOSS-Image Base DiT FP8
Copyright 2026 Aleksandr Mitroshenkov

This is a modified work. Voxprint quantized the MOSS-Image DiT to FP8 e4m3
weight-only with torchao 0.18.0 (float8_e4m3fn,per_row,v2). Compute stays in bf16.
The source revision, the source file sha256 values, the torchao version and the
quant config are recorded in voxprint-model.json and README.md.

